e CourtroomHow research linking climate change and extreme weather events is being used in lawsuits.Inside the High-Tech Insect FarmAlasdair Keane visits the underground insect farm turning food waste into animal feed.MWC Barcelona: What's New In Phone Tech?Paul Carter checks out the newest phones, gadgets and trends from MWC Barcelona. Norway's Fjords: Can Tourism Go Green?Alasdair Keane climbs aboard an electric boat in Norway.Inside Europe’s Space RaceAdrienne Murray visits the Esrange Spaceport in the extreme north of Sweden.Winter Olympics: Can Tech Boost Performance?Alasdair Keane visits the Olympic training centre in Oslo.Future Farming in AustraliaNick Kwek meets innovators using tech for Australia's agricultural industry.From Las Vegas, the latest trends and innovations at CES 2026.Jacqui Wakefield joins singer KT Tunstall as she sees her musical avatar.Space Exploration: Can Robots Lead the Way?Nick Kwek visits the National Space Industry Hub in Sydney.Icebreaker Tech: Navigating the ArcticAdrienne Murray meets the engineers designing icebreaker ship technology for the Arctic.Rising Seas: Can Tech Help Us Prepare?The scientists on a quest to improve our predictions of global sea level rise.Fixing Fashion's Sizing ProblemShiona McCallum meets an AI startup working to fix erratic clothing sizes in fashion.Movie Tech: Behind the ScenesAlasdair Keane explores a high-tech studio that transforms how car stunts are made.Brain Cells and BiocomputingZoe Kleinman meets the scientists trying to make living computers using brain cells.Cloud Seeding and Conspiracy TheoriesMarco Silva unpacks the science and technology of cloud seeding.IFA Berlin: The Rise of Smart TechAlasdair Keane explores the tech highlights at IFA Berlin.Lara Lewington explores the tech being trialled to find 'hidden' pancreatic cancer cases.Fighting Wildfires: Can Tech Help?How technology is bringing hope of earlier detection and prevention to wildfires.AI and the Future of HumanityJoe Tidy explores how the rise of artificial intelligence may play out.Sagrada Família: Can Tech Help Complete It?Yasmin Morgan-Griffiths has exclusive access to La Sagrada Familia in Barcelona.",
