      "id": "theverge-2026-07-23-the-echo-show-21-is-a-great-smart-home-hub-that-s-80-off",
      "title": "The Echo Show 21 is a great smart home hub that’s $80 off",
      "summary": "Echo Show's 21 attached to the adjustable stand, which is sold separately (and also discounted). | Image: Amazon\t\n\nSplit between buying a smart calendar, a kitchen TV, a smart home hub, and a smart display? Amazon’s Echo Show 21 is all of those things in one, with a huge 21-inch screen. You can use it to control your smart lights, glance at recipes, watch TV shows, and more. Currently, Best Buy an",
      "body": "Split between buying a smart calendar, a kitchen TV, a smart home hub, and a smart display? Amazon’s Echo Show 21 is all of those things in one, with a huge 21-inch screen. You can use it to control your smart lights, glance at recipes, watch TV shows, and more. Currently, Best Buy and Home Depot have the product on sale for $319.99 (usually $399.99), matching the lowest price we’ve seen to date.\n[Product: Amazon Echo Show 21 | https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Famazon-echo-show-21-full-hd-21-smart-display-for-home-organization-with-built-in-fire-tv-and-alexa-black%2FJ39HW6R5LZ, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.homedepot.com%2Fpep%2FAmazon-Echo-Show-21-HD-21-in-Smart-Display-with-Built-in-Fire-TV-and-Alexa-B0CDWWS127%2F333905187]\nThe Echo Show 21’s smart home controls are unique to it and the smaller Echo Show 15 that’s just $20 cheaper. They boast support for Zigbee, Matter, and Thread, providing seamless control for numerous devices. The included voice remote can’t interact with widgets or Alexa skills, but you can use it to control your streaming services or other media. There’s a built-in 13-megapixel camera, too, in case you want to video chat with a pal, with auto-framing to keep you centered even if you’re rushing around the house.\nThe panel is designed to mount on the wall, but if you’d rather set it on a counter or bookshelf, Best Buy is selling the adjustable stand for $99.99 (usually $124.99). The stand tilts up to 30 degrees, and swivels a full 360 degrees in case you want it in the center of your room, or on a kitchen island.",
      "source": "The Verge",
