    {
      "id": "theverge-2026-07-23-corsair-s-pc-case-with-a-panoramic-glass-design-is-70-off",
      "title": "Corsair’s PC case with a panoramic glass design is $70 off",
      "summary": "If only the air looked this cool as it flows through the Frame 4500X RS. | Image: Corsair\t\n\nOn the hunt for a PC case that’s loaded with features and has a unique look? Amazon, Best Buy, and Corsair are selling the Corsair Frame 4500X RS for $119.99, a $70 discount from the usual price. The versatile case supports motherboards up to EATX, GPUs up to 460mm in length, and has a seamless panoramic gl",
      "body": "On the hunt for a PC case that’s loaded with features and has a unique look? Amazon, Best Buy, and Corsair are selling the Corsair Frame 4500X RS for $119.99, a $70 discount from the usual price. The versatile case supports motherboards up to EATX, GPUs up to 460mm in length, and has a seamless panoramic glass window that wraps around its front and left side. The case includes three fans with reverse rotors mounted to its right side, letting the ARGB lighting shine into the case while they pull in air.\n[Product: CORSAIR Frame 4500X RS | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FJ2PYLFB?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fcorsair-frame-4500x-rs-r-argb-panoramic-glass-mid-tower-pc-case-white%2FJ39TSCPKS9, https://go.corsair.com/c/482924/490888/8513?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.corsair.com%2Fus%2Fen%2Fp%2Fpc-cases%2Fcc-9011315-ww%2Fframe-4500x-rs-r-argb-panoramic-glass-mid-tower-pc-case-white-cc-9011315-ww]\nWhile the panoramic window might draw more attention, one of this case’s standout functional features is Corsair’s Infinirail system. Rather than having individual holes for fan screws, there are long slots on sliding rails, giving you more flexibility with cooling components and configuration. As a result, you can fit radiators up to 280mm or 360mm on the top or side of the case, depending on whether you opt for 120mm or 140mm case fans.\nThe case also supports rear connection motherboards like this Gigabyte X870 Aorus for cleaner cable runs, and is ready for vertical GPU mounting if you buy a riser cable. There are some other nice inclusions as well, like an anti-sag GPU support arm, and the screws come in a reusable box rather than a series of tiny plastic bags. The case includes a two year manufacturer’s warranty.",
      "source": "The Verge",
      "category": "tech",
      "tags": [
        "Deals",
        "Gadgets",
        "Gaming",
        "PC Gaming",
        "Verge Shopping"
      ],
