      "id": "bbc-2026-07-23-what-about-cuts-for-cafes-and-hotels",
      "title": "What about cuts for cafes and hotels?",
      "summary": "The new PM has announced at 20% business rate cut for pubs, clubs and live music venues in England,",
      "body": "Up Next. India cockroach protests: Videos show officers firing 'pellet guns' Video, 00:02:01SubsectionAsiaPublished9 hours agoWatch: Another day, more Trump tariffs - but are they working? Video, 00:01:37SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished15 hours agoWatch: Wildfires rage across Spain and France. Video, 00:01:04SubsectionEuropePublished10 hours agoFamilies still search for bodies a month after Venezuela earthquakes. Video, 00:02:50SubsectionLatin AmericaPublished20 hours agoWhy have thousands taken to the streets? India's 'cockroach' protest explained. Video, 00:03:18SubsectionAsiaPublished17 hours agoLiquor store employee narrowly escapes leopard attack. Video, 00:00:33SubsectionAsiaPublished1 day agoWatch: Louvre reopens gallery after jewellery heist. Video, 00:00:37SubsectionEuropePublished2 days agoWatch: Beluga whales travel by plane and lorry to US from closed Canadian marine park. Video, 00:01:35SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished2 days ago'It's frustrating' - Canadians react to new US tariffs. Video, 00:01:26SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished3 days agoWatch Texas police officer pull man from burning car. Video, 00:00:41SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished3 days agoWatch: Flooded towns and evacuations as Chile hit by heavy rain. Video, 00:00:45SubsectionLatin AmericaPublished3 days ago",
