      "body": "Up Next. Liquor store employee narrowly escapes leopard attack. Video, 00:00:33SubsectionAsiaPublished13 hours agoWatch: Louvre reopens gallery after jewellery heist. Video, 00:00:37SubsectionEuropePublished1 day agoWatch: Beluga whales travel by plane and lorry to US from closed Canadian marine park. Video, 00:01:35SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished1 day ago'It's frustrating' - Canadians react to new US tariffs. Video, 00:01:26SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished2 days agoWatch Texas police officer pull man from burning car. Video, 00:00:41SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished2 days agoWatch: Flooded towns and evacuations as Chile hit by heavy rain. Video, 00:00:45SubsectionLatin AmericaPublished2 days agoWatch: 'My flat was turned into a brothel,' landlord tells BBC Panorama. Video, 00:02:28SubsectionBeds, Herts & BucksPublished3 days agoWhy are Ukraine's military recruiters facing violence in their own country? Video, 00:01:05SubsectionEuropePublished3 days agoSpanish and Argentinian fans react outside World Cup final. Video, 00:00:38SubsectionWorldPublished3 days agoMoment fans in Madrid celebrate World Cup win. Video, 00:01:04SubsectionEuropePublished4 days agoMarathon runners compete on drifting sea ice at North Pole. Video, 00:00:55SubsectionScience & EnvironmentPublished4 days ago",
