      "id": "hackernews-2026-07-22-original-apollo-11-guidance-computer-source-code-for-command",
      "title": "Original Apollo 11 Guidance Computer source code for command and lunar modules",
      "summary": "Article URL: https://github.com/chrislgarry/Apollo-11\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49002166\nPoints: 107\n# Comments: 31",
      "body": "Original Apollo 11 guidance computer (AGC) source code for Command Module (Comanche055) and Lunar Module (Luminary099). Digitized by the folks at Virtual AGC and MIT Museum. The goal is to be a repo for the original Apollo 11 source code. As such, PRs are welcome for any issues identified between the transcriptions in this repository and the original source scans for Luminary 099 and Comanche 055, as well as any files I may have missed.\nPlease read CONTRIBUTING.md before opening a pull request.\nIf you are interested in compiling the original source code, check\nPart of the source code for Colossus 2A, the Command Module's (CM) Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC) for Apollo 11Assemble revision 055 of AGC program Comanche by NASA2021113-051. 10:28 APR. 1, 1969\nPart of the source code for Luminary 1A, the Lunar Module's (LM) Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC) for Apollo 11Assemble revision 001 of AGC program LMY99 by NASA2021112-061. 16:27 JUL. 14, 1969\nThis source code has been transcribed or otherwise adapted from digitized images of a hardcopy from the MIT Museum. The digitization was performed by Paul Fjeld, and arranged for by Deborah Douglas of the Museum. Many thanks to both.\nThis AGC program shall also be referred to as Colossus 2A.\nThis program is intended for use in the Command Module as specified in report R-577. This program was prepared under DSR project 55-23870, sponsored by the Manned Spacecraft Center of The National Aeronautics and Space Administration through contract NAS 9-4065 with the Instrumentation Laboratory, Massachusetts Institute of Technology, Cambridge, Mass.\nColossus Programming LeaderApollo Guidance and Navigation\nDirector, Mission Program DevelopmentApollo Guidance and Navigation Program\nColossus Project ManagerApollo Guidance and Navigation Program\nDirector, Mission DevelopmentApollo Guidance and Navigation Program\nDirector, Mission DevelopmentApollo Guidance and Navigation Program\nDirectorApollo Guidance and Navigation Program",
      "source": "Hacker News",
      "category": "tech",
      "tags": [],
      "author": "noteness",
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-22T05:18:08.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://opengraph.githubassets.com/6584d6cee69ed18038b7c2da043fa77e507421646f5d13758aae20ce448ce46b/chrislgarry/Apollo-11",
      "originalUrl": "https://github.com/chrislgarry/Apollo-11",
      "readTimeMinutes": 1,
      "language": "en"
