      "author": "Brad Bourque",
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-20T20:08:51.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/18971331/BL3_FL4K_Skag.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,0,100,93.031429117804",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theverge.com/gadgets/968191/humble-2k-megahits-bundle-xcom-borderlands-duke-nukem-deal-sale",
