      "body": "Up Next. Beluga whales relocated from closed Canadian marine park arrive in US. Video, 00:01:35SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished3 hours ago'It's frustrating' - Canadians react to new US tariffs. Video, 00:01:26SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished11 hours agoWatch Texas police officer pull man from burning car. Video, 00:00:41SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished19 hours agoWatch: Flooded towns and evacuations as Chile hit by heavy rain. Video, 00:00:45SubsectionLatin AmericaPublished20 hours agoWatch: 'My flat was turned into a brothel,' landlord tells BBC Panorama. Video, 00:02:28SubsectionBeds, Herts & BucksPublished1 day agoWhy are Ukraine's military recruiters facing violence in their own country? Video, 00:01:05SubsectionEuropePublished1 day agoSpanish and Argentinian fans react outside World Cup final. Video, 00:00:38SubsectionWorldPublished2 days agoMoment fans in Madrid celebrate World Cup win. Video, 00:01:04SubsectionEuropePublished2 days agoMarathon runners compete on drifting sea ice at North Pole. Video, 00:00:55SubsectionScience & EnvironmentPublished2 days ago'A 10-goal thriller': England fans react to 6-4 win over France. Video, 00:00:39SubsectionEnglandPublished3 days agoHelicopters dump water as huge Norway fire destroys homes. Video, 00:00:51SubsectionEuropePublished4 days ago",
