      "id": "bbc-2026-07-20-who-is-the-new-pm",
      "title": "Who is the new PM?",
      "summary": "From Manchester mayor to prime minister; who is he and what does stand for?",
      "body": "Homepage    Accessibility links   Skip to content   Accessibility Help     BBC Account      Notifications        Home            News            Sport            Weather            iPlayer            Sounds            Bitesize     CBeebies     CBBC     Food         Home     News     Sport     Business     Technology     Health     Culture     Arts     Travel     Earth     Audio     Video     Live               More menu             Search iPlayer              Home            News            Sport            Weather            iPlayer            Sounds            Bitesize     CBeebies     CBBC     Food        Home     News     Sport     Business     Technology     Health     Culture     Arts     Travel     Earth     Audio     Video     Live         Close menu\niPlayer NavigationiPlayer Accessibility HelpFIFA World Cup;;Channels Sub NavigationBBC OneBBC TwoBBC ThreeBBC FourBBC Radio 1CBBCCBeebiesBBC ScotlandBBC NewsBBC ParliamentBBC AlbaS4CCategoriesCategory Sub NavigationDrama & SoapsFilmsComedyDocumentariesSportNewsEntertainmentMusicFoodLifestyleHistoryScience & NatureArtsFrom the ArchiveAudio DescribedSignedNorthern IrelandScotlandWalesCBeebiesCBBCDrama & SoapsFilmsComedyDocumentariesSportNewsEntertainmentMusicFoodLifestyleHistoryScience & NatureArtsFrom the ArchiveAccessible alternative formatsAudio DescribedSignedRegionsNorthern IrelandScotlandWalesChildren’sCBeebiesCBBCA-ZTV GuideWatchlistHomeBBC NewsAndy Burnham: Who is the new PM?BBC News - Andy Burnham: Who is the new PM?From Manchester Mayor to prime minister in a matter of months; Burnham has been in politics for decades but what is his record and what does he stand for? The BBC's Joe Pike explores who he is. Duration23 minsFirst shown20 Jul 2026Available for 11 monthsWatchlistAudio DescribedSign LanguageEpisodesEpisodes EpisodesThis episodeAndy Burnham: Who is the new PM?Boiling Point: The Week of Extreme HeatDanger to life warnings and record heat: how the UK and Europe struggled to cope.27 minsStarmer: What Went Wrong?From triumph to turmoil, the story of Sir Keir Starmer’s time in Number 10.26 mins Artemis II: Return to the MoonFour astronauts. One historic mission. Venturing further from earth than ever before.27 minsBondi Attack: Terror & BraveryIn just a few minutes, a Hanukkah celebration on a Sydney beach turns from joy to terror.21 minsHurricane Melissa: The Storm that Hit JamaicaOne of the most intense Atlantic hurricanes on record causes destruction in the Caribbean.25 minsWho Was Charlie Kirk?How did Charlie Kirk become one of the most important conservative activists in the US?30 minsTaylor & Travis: Their Love StoryFrom how they met, to that ring! The engagement story of Taylor Swift and Travis Kelce.16 minsOzzy Osbourne: Remembering a Rock GodFrom rock star to reality TV, fans and friends reflect on Ozzy Osbourne's life and career.20 minsAir India Plane CrashThe shocking story of a plane crash that killed all but one onboard.22 minsDC Disaster: The Washington Plane CrashTragedy in the skies - the shocking DC plane crash and its devastating aftermath.25 minsLos Angeles on FireClive Myrie looks at how the devastating fires unfolded and whether LA can rebuild.29 minsJapan Plane CrashThe story of a deadly plane collision and the evacuation that prevented further tragedy.15 minsLiam Payne: What Happened?The story of former One Direction star Liam Payne's tragic death in Argentina.18 minsTrump Assassination Attempt: What Happened?First-hand accounts from BBC journalists and eyewitnesses at the scene in Pennsylvania.29 minsCo-op Live: Concerts & ChaosThe UK's largest indoor arena, plagued with postponements and problems, finally opens.19 minsBaltimore Bridge CollapseAn investigation into the container ship crash that brought down a Baltimore bridge.19 minsKate's Cancer DiagnosisHow the Princess of Wales revealed her cancer diagnosis in a video message to the world.22 minsManhunt: Clapham Chemical AttackThe search for Abdul Shokoor Ezedi.16 mins